# PUBLIC repo — git must never commit secret material, even if it lands
# in the source tree (belt-and-suspenders behind .chezmoiignore).
*id_rsa*
*id_ed25519*
*id_ecdsa*
*.pem
*.key
# NOTE: *.age / *.gpg are intentionally NOT ignored — encrypted blobs are meant
# to live in the repo; that's how the age-encrypted token survives a reinstall.
*hosts.yml
*credentials*
*.netrc
.git-credentials
key.txt
